stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued
  queued --> dispatched: agent connected
  queued --> cancelled: user cancels or expires
  dispatched --> running: agent accepted
  dispatched --> timed_out: no answer in time
  running --> succeeded
  running --> failed
  running --> timed_out
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  timed_out --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
